{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["對以色列和猶大的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「祭司啊，要聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，要留心聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王室啊，要側耳聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是對你們的審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們像設在米斯巴的圈套，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鋪在他泊山的網羅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些叛逆之徒大肆殺戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要責罰你們所有人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我對以法蓮一清二楚，以色列瞞不過我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮做了妓女，以色列被玷污了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他們的惡行阻撓他們歸向自己的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為淫亂之靈佔據了他們的心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們不認識耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列被自己的傲慢指控，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列和以法蓮要跌倒在自己的罪中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大也要一同跌倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們牽著牛羊去尋求耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻尋不到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂已離他們而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們對耶和華不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所生的是私生子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們和他們的田地必在朔日被吞噬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「要在基比亞吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拉瑪鳴號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在伯·亞文吶喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅憫啊，敵人就在你身後！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮啊，你要在受懲罰的日子淪為廢墟！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在以色列各支派中宣告將來必要發生的事！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大的首領如同擅移地界的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"侵吞以色列的領土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將烈怒如洪水般傾瀉在他們身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮因甘願追隨偶像而受欺壓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被審判壓碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使以法蓮像蟲蛀的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使猶大家像朽爛的木頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮見自己患病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大見自己有傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮便向強大的亞述王","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"求救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述王卻不能醫治你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也無法為你們療傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像獅子一樣對待以法蓮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如猛獅一樣對待猶大家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他們撕碎、拖走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能營救他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要返回我的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他們知罪來尋求我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在苦難的日子裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必懇切地尋求我。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"「強大的亞述王」或譯為「耶雷布王」，同10·6。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}